  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The order of first four elements of group-17 are as follows.<br />\\(\\mathrm{F}  \\lt \\mathrm{Cl} \\lt \\mathrm{Br} \\lt \\mathrm{I}\\) (Covalent radius)<br />\\(\\mathrm{Cl}  \\gt  \\mathrm{F}  \\gt  \\mathrm{Br}  \\gt  \\mathrm{I}\\) (Electron affinity)<br />\\(\\mathrm{F}^{-} \\lt \\mathrm{Cl}^{-} \\lt \\mathrm{Br}^{-} \\lt \\mathrm{I}^{-}\\)(Ionic radius)<br />\\(\\mathrm{F}  \\gt  \\mathrm{Cl}  \\gt  \\mathrm{Br}  \\gt  \\mathrm{I}\\left(\\mathrm{I}^{\\text {st }}\\right.\\) ionization energy\\)<br />Electron affinity order is irregular.",
    "image": null
  },
